OL,3,ATemperatures to briefly touch 27C
OL,4,Adespite more rain on the way for some
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bust of early autumn warmth will see
OL,7,Ftemperatures rise as high as 27C in
OL,8,Fsouth-east England by the weekend,
OL,9,Fwhilst more rain is on the way further
OL,10,Fnorth.
OL,12,FTemperatures will be a few degrees
OL,13,Fabove average across the UK for most,
OL,14,Fwith Thursday and Sunday looking
OL,15,Fparticularly warm in the south.
OL,17,FThe unsettled theme also continues,
OL,18,Fwith low pressure systems bringing rain
OL,19,Fat times, focused towards the
OL,20,Fnorth-west.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
